const interestNote='Compound Interest replaces ordinary flat passive XP at Level 20: current XP bank ×0.01%, maximum2 actual XP/sec. At Level26: ×0.015%, maximum3 actual XP/sec. At Level30: ×0.025%, maximum5 actual XP/sec. Capped interest never increases XP requirements; permanent Level10/20/30 discounts and the Discount Potion still apply. Active physical Exp Jokers multiply the rate BEFORE the hard cap. Level15, manual22 and Exp Potion do not multiply interest. Knowledge separately earns1 XP/sec times Exp Jokers only. Visible game only; no offline/hidden/reload catch-up; long gaps skipped.';
